PANDAS:

Now we're moving from:

Numerical arrays(Numpy) to Real-world tabular data.

This is a major transition.

Think about our dirty CSV from earlier:

name,age,score
John,20,75
Mary,19,82
David,21,
Sarah,20,91
Peter,22,55
Grace,,88
James,21,73

We manually dealt with that using csv.DictReader.

It worked.But imagine having:

100,000 rows
50 columns
missing values
duplicate records
different data types
dates
categorical data

Writing everything manually with csv would become painful.

Pandas exists to make working with structured/tabular data much easier.